    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24778" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάημι</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ</span>], impf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάην,</span>
		
			Ep.
		 Verb, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blow
			through,</i> c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς [θάμνους] . . οὔτ᾽ ἀνέμων διάη
					μένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.478
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πώεα . . οὐ διάησι ἲς ἀνέμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					517
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν [οὐρῶν] ψυχρὸς ἐὼν
				διάησι [Βορέας</span>] ib.<i><span class="en">
				514
			</span></i>.</div>
